{"title":"Rocket City Math League","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Rocket City Math League</b> is a national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a> for middle and high school students run by students at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Virgil_I._Grissom_High_School&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Virgil I. Grissom High School (page does not exist)\">Virgil I. Grissom High School</a> in Huntsville, Alabama.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.rocketcitymath.org/index2.htm\">Homepage</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rocket_City_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=305\">RCML Forum</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li>The contest is divided into several categories:  Pre Algebra(Explorer), Algebra I(Mercury), Geometry(Gemini), Algebra II(Apollo), and Comprehensive(Discovery).</li></ul>\n<p>Problems range from calculus in Discovery to topics covered in 5th or 6th grade in Explorer\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Rocket_City_Math_League&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017195029\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 310/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.800      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.800      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1594:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017195029 and revision id 32785. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}